### Design Rationale Summary

| Aspect | Decision | Justification |
|--------|----------|---------------|
| Rule type | `position_near_with_facing` | Both are "find" tasks — per preference order, this is the preferred rule for find/locate/observe tasks |
| max_distance | 16 | Generous — smoker is ~7 blocks from spawn, melons ~6 blocks. Allows detection from reasonable viewing distance |
| facing_tolerance | 60° | Standard tolerance — ensures player is actually looking toward the target, not just standing nearby facing away |
| coordinate_frame | spawn_relative | Required per spec — evaluator converts to absolute coords automatically |
| Single rule per milestone | Yes | Each task has one clear completion criterion — no over-specification |
| No inventory_has | Correct | These are pure "find" tasks — player doesn't need to pick up or mine anything |
| No position_inside_box | Correct | These aren't pure navigation tasks — the player needs to *see* the targets |

